OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tue 22 Sep to Thu 1 OctFThe
OL,6,Ffirst part of this period will likely
OL,7,Fsee a build of pressure across much of
OL,8,Fthe UK, with Atlantic weather fronts
OL,9,Fbecoming more confined to the far
OL,10,Fnorth west. As such, plenty of dry and
OL,11,Fincreasingly warm and perhaps rather
OL,12,Fhumid weather will develop across the
OL,13,Fmajority of areas. Thereafter, likely
OL,14,Fturning changeable again, with spells
OL,15,Fof rain and showers interspersed with
OL,16,Fsome short-lived spells of more
OL,17,Fsettled weather and temperatures
OL,18,Freturning to near normal overall.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
