OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F163A1789649405
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thu 1 Oct to Thu 15 Oct
OL,6,FChangeable weather may become more
OL,7,Ffrequent as we move into October, with
OL,8,Fperiods of rain and stronger winds
OL,9,Fbecoming more likely to spread from
OL,10,Fthe west, although with drier and
OL,11,Fbrighter spells also. As is not
OL,12,Funtypical as we move towards mid-
OL,13,FOctober, deeper low pressure systems
OL,14,Fcould bring occasional periods of very
OL,15,Fstrong winds. Temperatures are likely
OL,16,Fto remain above normal overall, though
OL,17,Fbrief cooler interludes are also
OL,18,Fpossible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
